PN,41701
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,FA county Fermanagh mother has told UTV
OL,7,Fabout her frustration that a drug
OL,8,Fwhich could slow the effects of her
OL,9,Fneurodegenerative disease, is not
OL,10,Favailable on the health service in
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland, despite it being
OL,12,Favailable in other European countries.
OL,14,FThe treatment was approved last year
OL,15,Fbut hasn't been made available in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland as the health
OL,17,Fdepartment here follows the lead of
OL,18,Fthe NHS in England which hasn't been
OL,19,Fable to agree on cost.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,FMum Michelle has Friedreich's ataxia,
OL,7,Fa rare neurodegenerative disease that
OL,8,Fcan impact movement, speech, and
OL,9,Fswallowing.
OL,11,FMichelle Beagan said: "In some ways,
OL,12,Fgetting the diagnosis was a relief
OL,13,Fbecause you understood that you didn't
OL,14,Fhave`you weren't making this up.
OL,16,F"But in other ways, it was like a
OL,17,Fdeath sentence, I suppose, because I
OL,18,Fwaited so long for a diagnosis.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,F"So I had done a lot of research
OL,7,Fmyself, and I had stumbled across
OL,8,FFriedreich's ataxia, and I do remember
OL,9,Fthinking, 'I hope I don't have that'
OL,10,Fand that's what I ended up with."
OL,12,FIt's thought around 1,000 to 2,000
OL,13,Fpeople have the disease in the UK.
OL,15,FAs it is so rare, Michelle says it's
OL,16,Fdifficult to know exactly how quickly
OL,17,Fher condition could change.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,FShe continued: "I suppose in that
OL,7,Frespect, I have progressed to using a
OL,8,Frollator, so then that would in turn
OL,9,Fprogress to using a wheelchair.
OL,11,F"Maybe not being as mobile or as
OL,12,Findependent as I am at the moment.
OL,14,F"Which hopefully, I'm trying to battle
OL,15,Fagainst, but you're battling against
OL,16,Ftime here and the unknown."
OL,18,FThere is some hope, but it's mixed
OL,19,Fwith frustration and sadness.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,FA drug was approved last year that can
OL,7,Fslow the effects of the disease, but
OL,8,Fit's not available on the health
OL,9,Fservice here because of cost.
OL,11,FDr Julie Greenfield, Ataxia UK said:
OL,12,F"In other countries, it is widely
OL,13,Favailable.
OL,15,F"In many European countries, it's
OL,16,Feither already reimbursed by the
OL,17,FNational Health Services, or there are
OL,18,Finterim access pathways whereby people
OL,19,Fare sort of able to have the medicine
OL,20,Fwhilst these reimbursement decisions
OL,21,Fare taking place.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,F"So, we're calling for changes in the
OL,7,Fway rare diseases are evaluated, which
OL,8,Fwould result hopefully in more rare
OL,9,Fdiseases being approved for
OL,10,Freimbursements within the NHS."
OL,12,FDespite an unpredictable future,
OL,13,FMichelle tries to stay strong for her
OL,14,Ftwo boys.
OL,16,FMichelle said: "On those days that I'm
OL,17,Fperhaps thinking, you know, 'I can't
OL,18,Fdo this anymore' and 'this too hard?',
OL,19,Fthen I think of them and how much they
OL,20,Fneed me.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,F"How much this drug also would help
OL,7,Fthem, because it would mean their mum
OL,8,Fwould be able to do a lot more with
OL,9,Fthem for a lot longer than perhaps
OL,10,Fwithout the drug."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786042168
OL,3,CMum with rare neurodegenerative
OL,4,Cdisease 'battling against time'
OL,6,FIn a statement, the Department of
OL,7,FHealth said: "The NICE appraisal for
OL,8,Fthis drug in people 16 years and over
OL,9,Fwas terminated in May 2025 after the
OL,10,Fmanufacturer, Biogen, withdrew its
OL,11,Fevidence submission. NICE will review
OL,12,Fthe decision if Biogen decides to make
OL,13,Fa new submission. In Northern Ireland,
OL,14,Fit's not accepted for use for the
OL,15,Ftreatment of Friedreich's ataxia in
OL,16,Faccordance with advice issued by the
OL,17,FScottish Medicines Consortium in March
OL,18,F2026."
OL,20,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,21,FITVX
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/9
